             the screen is already showing would cost the phone thirty JPEG
             decodes a second to produce no visible change, and would flicker
             the stage on some browsers. Just keep the loop running.
             Only when we are genuinely still showing that picture (imgOk) and
             at the size now being asked for — otherwise the name matching is
             true but irrelevant and the picture must be rebuilt. */
          if(tag && tag === picTag && imgOk && want === picShownW){
