           wrong: there was no 304 and nothing was cheap. The reply was the
           whole ~50 KB JPEG, every time, about nine times out of ten, because
           the request carried a cache-buster that made it a brand new
           question the board could only answer in full. Both halves — the
           no-store header on the board and the cache-buster here — had to go
           before a single 304 was possible.
